WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:18.935
Flopsy went outside.

2
00:00:18.936 --> 00:00:33.981
"Where are my sisters?" she said.

3
00:00:33.982 --> 00:00:38.940
Flopsy twitched her nose.

4
00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:45.713
"They went this way!" she said.

5
00:00:45.714 --> 00:00:50.106
She hopped along the path.

6
00:00:50.107 --> 00:00:53.260
Tommy Brock hurried back to his den.

7
00:00:53.261 --> 00:00:56.223
He was carrying Mopsy and Cotton-tail.

8
00:00:56.223 --> 00:01:03.035
"Rabbits!" Tommy thought happily.

9
00:01:03.035 --> 00:01:05.994
Tommy opened the oven door.

10
00:01:05.995 --> 00:01:12.150
He put the rabbits inside.

11
00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:16.044
"I'll eat dinner later,” he said.

12
00:01:16.045 --> 00:01:24.026
The two little bunnies started to cry.

13
00:01:24.027 --> 00:01:28.811
"I miss Mother and Flopsy," Cotton-tail said.

14
00:01:28.819 --> 00:01:32.384
"Me too," Mopsy said.

15
00:01:32.384 --> 00:01:42.892
"We’ll never see them again!"

16
00:01:42.893 --> 00:01:49.740
The badger looked for more food.

17
00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:52.796
He found some eggs.

18
00:01:52.797 --> 00:01:56.492
"I will eat these too," he said.

19
00:01:56.492 --> 00:02:00.140
Tommy yawned.

20
00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:16.904
"I'm tired after moving," he thought.

21
00:02:16.904 --> 00:02:19.803
"I will take a quick nap.

22
00:02:19.804 --> 00:02:22.995
Then I will eat my dinner."

23
00:02:22.995 --> 00:02:38.109
Flopsy hopped along the lane.

24
00:02:38.109 --> 00:02:43.000
Her nose twitched near a den.

25
00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:45.511
Then she heard a cry.

26
00:02:45.512 --> 00:02:51.227
"Mopsy?" Flopsy thought.

27
00:02:51.227 --> 00:02:55.163
Just then Flopsy saw something else.

28
00:02:55.164 --> 00:02:57.833
It was a red fox.

29
00:02:57.833 --> 00:03:00.992
"Uh-oh," Flopsy thought.

30
00:03:00.992 --> 00:03:06.880
She hid fast!
